### API Request Description

This endpoint makes an HTTP GET request to `{{UMH Local}}api/newToken` to retrieve a new token.

#### Request Body

This request does not require a request body.

#### Response Body

The response is in JSON format with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "Authorization": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

The response includes the `Authorization` key, which contains the new token.

### Health Check API

This API endpoint sends an HTTP GET request to {{UMHProdGCloud}}api/health to perform a health check of the system.

#### Request

The request does not require a request body. It simply sends an HTTP GET request to the specified endpoint.

#### Response

The response for this request is a JSON object representing the health status of the system. Below is a JSON schema representing the structure of the response:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "details": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

The `status` property indicates the overall health status, while the `details` property provides additional details about the health status.

